<title>USA: Delta Air carrier to accept cargo shipment.</title>
<headline>Delta Air carrier to accept cargo shipment.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines said Friday its low-fare carrier Delta Express will begin accepting cargo for shipment on all of its flights beginning February 24.</p>
<p>Delta Express does 128 daily non-stop flights from 10 U.S. Northeast and Midwest cities to Orlando and four other destinations in Florida, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
